Subject: [PATCH 24/28] fix(truthprobe): measure entropy over the alternatives
 it normalises by

- top_logprobs longer than top_k inflated H while still dividing by ln(top_k),
  so phi saturated at zero; both sides now use the same slice
- cover status partial, ASCII/UTF-16 digit density and the top_k boundary
