Subject: [PATCH 27/28] fix(desktop): keep the reported CLI version out of the
 stage stamp

A content hash appended to opencode-cli.version made the desktop expect
version <v>+<sha> while the CLI registers <v>, so matchesVersion never agreed,
the background service was replaced on every attempt and startup timed out.

